      "card_ids": ["C08"],
      "claim": "The sigma1 radiotracer [18F]-(R)-20, a fluoroalkoxy tetralin/piperidine analogue, reached 3.4% ID/g in brain, showing robust BBB permeation; the query shares the piperidine-tetralin/fluoroalkyl motif.",
